reagent-name-scp207 = SCP-207-1
reagent-desc-scp207 = Anomalous cola. Removes fatigue and progressively accelerates movement, but the body cannot withstand the strain. The effect persists after the substance is metabolized.
scp207-effect-start = Energy surges through you. You feel as though you will never need rest again.
scp207-effect-damage = Your heart is racing. A sharp pain spreads through your body!
scp207-examine = [color=yellow]Their movements are unusually fast and restless.[/color]
